{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "754f13c6-3a64-8e74-9949-8b9dd66fff44",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T15:39:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, parking violations, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I assist you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, I got a ticket and I'm putting you on speaker, my hands are, hold on. Okay. Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you. Please state your name and the nature of your call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonella Santoro. And it's about a ticket for the snow parking ban. Forty, no, it was last week, the ticket was last week. Sorry, you asked my name, I gave that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. Do you have the ticket number in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have it somewhere. It's on the, [pause] it's yellow, if that helps. Honestly the point is, that street was never plowed. Not once. And I didn't see any sign posted either. So how am I getting a ticket for a ban?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I can look it up by your plate number if you prefer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's a blue Subaru. Oh, you want the plate. Right. Sorry. It's, um, [line breaks up] hold on, I'll read it off the ticket. Okay, here it is. I'll give you the plate in a second, I'm just saying, no plow came down there. Nobody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ma'am, I will need the plate number to locate the citation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. I'll find it. [pause] Oh, shoot, hang on. [inaudible] Sorry, I dropped a ball."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I beg your pardon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A juggling ball. I'm learning to juggle. Don't ask. It's rolling under the desk. Anyway, the plate, okay, I've got the ticket now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very well. Whenever you are ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the ticket number first, you said. It's, um, [crosstalk] no, sorry, you wanted the plate. I keep doing that. Plate is on the ticket here, give me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, Ms. Santoro."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:38:00-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I found it, and I'll read it to you, but can I ask something first? Is there a payment plan? Because I run a shop, December is slow, and paying this whole thing at once is, well, it's an annoyance on top of an annoyance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can note your inquiry. In general, the office does have options for arranging payment on outstanding citations, but I would need to review the account first. Separately, you may contest the ticket if you believe it was issued in error."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Contest it, yes, that's what I want, the street was never plowed or posted. Can you do that over the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Contesting is handled through a written request or an in-person hearing request. I can tell you how to start that once I have the citation in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Okay, the plate, finally. It's ready now. Go ahead and ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please read the plate number, one character at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:39:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's, ugh, [inaudible] sorry, the ball again. One sec. If you need to reach me, my number is 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T15:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I have that number. Please read the plate whenever you're ready."
    }
  ],
